1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:50,040 --> 00:01:51,960
You protected me for more than 2000 years,

25
00:01:53,160 --> 00:01:53,960
you...

26
00:01:54,360 --> 00:01:55,240
worked hard.

27
00:01:56,120 --> 00:01:58,800
I will make you the Sword Spirit of this celestial sword.

28
00:01:58,880 --> 00:02:00,200
In 10 000 years,

29
00:02:00,800 --> 00:02:02,240
you will become a Celestial Saint.

30
00:02:31,200 --> 00:02:34,280
Central Fragment
Rain Celestial Realm

31
00:02:33,120 --> 00:02:35,480
A Rain Celestial Sword appeared.

32
00:02:35,560 --> 00:02:36,440
If I get it,

33
00:02:36,480 --> 00:02:38,640
it will improve the strength of planet Tian Mo.

34
00:02:36,320 --> 00:02:39,560
Tian Mozi
Middle stage Nirvana Scryer
Planet Tian Mo

35
00:02:38,840 --> 00:02:41,720
I just don't know which Rain Celestial Sword it is...

36
00:02:42,240 --> 00:02:44,360
Southwest Fragment
Rain Celestial Realm

37
00:02:45,640 --> 00:02:46,880
A celestial sword ?

38
00:02:47,720 --> 00:02:51,420
My beast is able to control the Sword Spirit within the sword.

39
00:02:47,160 --> 00:02:50,480
Ling Tianhou
Late stage Nirvana Cleanser
Da Lou Sword Sect Leader

40
00:02:51,520 --> 00:02:55,000
With it, planet Tian Yun will finally be mine.

41
00:03:18,360 --> 00:03:19,280
Brother Chi Hu,

42
00:03:19,320 --> 00:03:20,520
star compass !

43
00:03:31,600 --> 00:03:33,360
Thanks to Brother Ceng,

44
00:03:33,400 --> 00:03:35,360
we are out of danger for now.

45
00:03:35,400 --> 00:03:37,360
But the star compass is still damaged.

46
00:03:37,400 --> 00:03:39,720
I'm afraid it won't take us far enough to cross the void.

47
00:03:40,320 --> 00:03:41,760
The star compass,

48
00:03:42,280 --> 00:03:43,840
the treasure of the Giant Demon Clan.

49
00:03:45,520 --> 00:03:46,640
Sadly,

50
00:03:47,080 --> 00:03:48,880
it's only an imitation.

51
00:03:51,200 --> 00:03:52,000
Ceng Niu,

52
00:03:52,540 --> 00:03:54,680
if you agree to release the seal,

53
00:03:54,840 --> 00:03:57,480
I can promise to safely return you to planet Suzaku.

54
00:03:58,480 --> 00:03:59,800
How does it sound ?

55
00:04:08,120 --> 00:04:11,240
I don't just have 3 souls, but a fourth one as well.

56
00:04:11,320 --> 00:04:13,840
The fourth one is inside the body in the coffin.

57
00:04:15,800 --> 00:04:18,040
Senior Zhou Yi never mentioned a fourth soul.

58
00:04:18,680 --> 00:04:20,200
He might be lying

59
00:04:20,320 --> 00:04:21,440
so let's probe him.

60
00:04:22,360 --> 00:04:23,880
I'm afraid Senior's words

61
00:04:23,960 --> 00:04:25,520
must have some other meaning.

62
00:04:25,720 --> 00:04:27,200
Besides, you must already know

63
00:04:27,640 --> 00:04:29,120
that I cannot break

64
00:04:29,440 --> 00:04:31,320
the seal of an Ascendant cultivator.

65
00:04:39,280 --> 00:04:40,240
Alright,

66
00:04:40,520 --> 00:04:41,920
you have some guts.

67
00:04:42,240 --> 00:04:44,480
No wonder you are the one Zhou Yi chose.

68
00:04:44,680 --> 00:04:46,720
Now come with me right now !

69
00:04:47,320 --> 00:04:48,600
The slave seal is unstable.

70
00:04:48,610 --> 00:04:49,960
Use the pagoda to protect yourself.

71
00:04:53,080 --> 00:04:53,880
Sun Tai,

72
00:04:54,440 --> 00:04:56,840
Senior Zhou Yi specifically made this pagoda

73
00:04:57,320 --> 00:04:59,040
so that it could kill you.

74
00:05:01,480 --> 00:05:02,680
Zhou Yi...

75
00:05:02,920 --> 00:05:04,080
I know a little bit

76
00:05:04,320 --> 00:05:05,800
about your Corpse Sect.

77
00:05:06,520 --> 00:05:08,080
The corpse inside the coffin

78
00:05:08,720 --> 00:05:10,640
most likely contains someone else's soul.

79
00:05:12,080 --> 00:05:13,720
Even if it's your fourth soul,

80
00:05:13,960 --> 00:05:15,560
it's a broken soul !

81
00:05:16,640 --> 00:05:19,440
I won’t lower myself to deal with a Junior like you !

82
00:05:22,040 --> 00:05:23,120
Since he retreated,

83
00:05:23,960 --> 00:05:26,040
the fourth soul must be a lie.

84
00:05:26,560 --> 00:05:28,040
He can't take this risk.

85
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:31,760
Brother Ceng,

86
00:05:32,240 --> 00:05:33,640
Sun Tai's cultivation is very high.

87
00:05:34,040 --> 00:05:35,640
You have to be careful in the future.

88
00:05:36,840 --> 00:05:37,640
Don't worry,

89
00:05:38,120 --> 00:05:39,840
Senior Zhou Yi told me that keeping him alive

90
00:05:40,240 --> 00:05:41,840
serves a greater purpose.

91
00:05:41,880 --> 00:05:45,400
Otherwise I would have already killed him and his fourth soul.

92
00:05:51,120 --> 00:05:53,160
I can't kill him, I can't trap him...

93
00:05:53,480 --> 00:05:55,160
He's really troublesome...

94
00:05:57,120 --> 00:05:59,480
It seems Zhou Yi intends to use me for something,

95
00:05:59,770 --> 00:06:01,760
I have to find out what it is.

96
00:06:08,840 --> 00:06:09,800
Brother Ceng,

97
00:06:09,840 --> 00:06:11,800
this star compass can no longer fly.

98
00:06:12,040 --> 00:06:13,640
We will have to fly on our own.

99
00:06:14,000 --> 00:06:14,800
Brother Chi Hu,

100
00:06:15,360 --> 00:06:17,360
you only brought one star compass ?

101
00:06:18,240 --> 00:06:19,320
This treasure

102
00:06:19,720 --> 00:06:21,040
was brought by my clan

103
00:06:21,320 --> 00:06:23,560
when we migrated to Suzaku countless years ago.

104
00:06:23,960 --> 00:06:25,440
But now that it's broken,

105
00:06:26,040 --> 00:06:27,400
I’ll be punished for sure

106
00:06:27,680 --> 00:06:28,840
when I get back.

107
00:06:30,840 --> 00:06:31,640
Brother Chi Hu,

108
00:06:32,240 --> 00:06:33,630
I won’t lie to you,

109
00:06:33,720 --> 00:06:35,160
I can repair this star compass.

110
00:06:37,240 --> 00:06:39,440
But the material to repair it is too precious.

111
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:41,240
If I repair it

112
00:06:41,800 --> 00:06:43,520
then it must belong to me.

113
00:06:44,640 --> 00:06:45,760
This...

114
00:06:47,720 --> 00:06:48,520
Forget it,

115
00:06:49,240 --> 00:06:50,960
if it is too difficult for Brother Chi Hu,

116
00:06:51,000 --> 00:06:52,200
I’m still willing to fix it for you

117
00:06:52,680 --> 00:06:54,600
as a token of our friendship.

118
00:06:55,000 --> 00:06:56,400
Is what you’re saying true ?

119
00:06:56,480 --> 00:06:57,520
It is true.

120
00:06:58,400 --> 00:07:01,120
However, I will need this star compass for something in the future,

121
00:07:01,160 --> 00:07:03,680
so when I need to borrow it, don’t reject me.

122
00:07:05,840 --> 00:07:08,040
With the temperament of my clan's Elders,

123
00:07:08,200 --> 00:07:10,120
there's no way they would lend it to you.

124
00:07:10,560 --> 00:07:11,810
That's why

125
00:07:11,920 --> 00:07:13,960
I might as well gift it to you !

126
00:07:18,920 --> 00:07:19,600
Brother Ceng,

127
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:22,120
this star compass is now yours.

128
00:07:24,040 --> 00:07:25,040
Thank you very much.

129
00:07:30,440 --> 00:07:32,360
I will have to ask Brother Chi Hu to protect me.

130
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:45,960
According to Tu Si's memory,

131
00:07:46,040 --> 00:07:48,600
a star compass is made of this material.

132
00:08:00,360 --> 00:08:01,440
This Ceng Niu

133
00:08:01,560 --> 00:08:03,840
has a shocking cultivation and courage.

134
00:08:04,040 --> 00:08:06,360
He also obtained Zhou Yi's Ascendant Crystal.

135
00:08:06,720 --> 00:08:08,240
If he becomes a true friend,

136
00:08:08,720 --> 00:08:11,560
it will benefit the clan in the future.

137
00:08:27,840 --> 00:08:28,520
Brother Ceng,

138
00:08:28,880 --> 00:08:30,280
are you done repairing it ?

139
00:08:30,960 --> 00:08:33,320
There should be no problems leaving this void.

140
00:08:35,120 --> 00:08:38,240
Central Fragment
Rain Celestial Realm

141
00:08:40,440 --> 00:08:41,800
Second Rain Celestial Sword,

142
00:08:41,840 --> 00:08:42,960
appear !

143
00:08:45,320 --> 00:08:46,680
Second Rain Celestial Sword

144
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:52,000
If the Celestial Realm was still intact,

145
00:08:52,040 --> 00:08:53,920
I would just throw your soul

146
00:08:53,960 --> 00:08:55,920
in the Celestial Purification Pond.

147
00:08:57,200 --> 00:08:59,600
But now that it's gone, to restore your Origin Soul,

148
00:09:00,160 --> 00:09:01,880
one Rain Celestial Sword

149
00:09:02,520 --> 00:09:03,280
is too slow.

150
00:09:04,800 --> 00:09:05,600
Ting'er,

151
00:09:06,080 --> 00:09:07,680
why are you doing all of this ?

152
00:09:07,920 --> 00:09:09,760
Do you want to waste the celestial spiritual energy

153
00:09:09,800 --> 00:09:11,600
I have gathered for you during thousands of years ?

154
00:09:09,440 --> 00:09:11,600
Zhou Yi
Sword Spirit

155
00:09:12,320 --> 00:09:13,600
I refuse to let you die,

156
00:09:13,840 --> 00:09:15,080
so you will not die.

157
00:09:15,920 --> 00:09:17,080
And my name

158
00:09:18,080 --> 00:09:19,480
is not Ting'er.

159
00:09:22,520 --> 00:09:23,520
Sure...

160
00:09:24,520 --> 00:09:26,080
you are not called Ting'er…

161
00:09:27,400 --> 00:09:29,480
I have already remembered everything…

162
00:09:31,240 --> 00:09:32,040
However,

163
00:09:34,240 --> 00:09:35,440
this name, Ting'er…

164
00:09:36,120 --> 00:09:37,340
I like it

165
00:09:37,440 --> 00:09:38,440
very much.

166
00:09:50,280 --> 00:09:51,480
They're coming.

167
00:09:57,960 --> 00:09:58,760
That's...

168
00:10:00,520 --> 00:10:01,520
celestial swords ?

169
00:10:08,600 --> 00:10:09,800
Where are they coming from ?

170
00:10:40,240 --> 00:10:43,440
Third Rain Celestial Sword

171
00:10:45,960 --> 00:10:46,640
Celestial swords !

172
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:52,680
They really are celestial swords !

173
00:10:57,680 --> 00:10:58,280
Ting'er,

174
00:10:58,440 --> 00:11:00,200
are 3 Rain Celestial Swords not enough ?

175
00:11:00,840 --> 00:11:01,880
It's not enough,

176
00:11:01,960 --> 00:11:05,160
the Fourth Rain Celestial Sword will soon take form.

177
00:11:25,560 --> 00:11:26,960
A celestial Qilin...

178
00:11:27,040 --> 00:11:28,920
The Da Lou Sword Sect’s guardian beast !

179
00:11:29,840 --> 00:11:31,880
This beast belongs to Sword Saint Ling Tianhou !

180
00:11:31,880 --> 00:11:32,760
Is he...

181
00:11:33,000 --> 00:11:34,440
Welcome Master.

182
00:11:49,840 --> 00:11:51,120
A single glance was enough

183
00:11:51,120 --> 00:11:52,440
to be injured by his sword intent.

184
00:11:53,040 --> 00:11:54,360
This old man's cultivation

185
00:11:54,760 --> 00:11:55,920
is terrifying.

186
00:11:56,840 --> 00:11:59,520
Are you a Celestial ?

187
00:11:59,680 --> 00:12:00,800
A Celestial ?!

188
00:12:00,840 --> 00:12:01,720
How can this be ?

189
00:12:02,960 --> 00:12:04,320
Even if she is a Celestial,

190
00:12:04,600 --> 00:12:06,400
there is no way she can match Ling Tianhou.

191
00:12:07,640 --> 00:12:08,360
Stand down !

192
00:12:10,760 --> 00:12:12,640
The Celestial Realm has already collapsed.

193
00:12:12,760 --> 00:12:14,440
If you really are a surviving Celestial,

194
00:12:14,600 --> 00:12:17,680
then this old man wants to try killing a Celestial !

195
00:12:20,840 --> 00:12:21,720
You evil creature,

196
00:12:22,200 --> 00:12:23,410
even your ancestors back then

197
00:12:23,640 --> 00:12:26,320
didn’t dare to act like this before me.

198
00:12:26,680 --> 00:12:28,400
Could it be that you lost

199
00:12:28,520 --> 00:12:31,360
your memory inheritance after the Celestial Realm collapsed ?

200
00:12:42,400 --> 00:12:45,200
So you are a fake beast that never received an inheritance.

201
00:12:51,560 --> 00:12:52,680
You remember now ?

202
00:12:55,520 --> 00:12:56,320
Forget it,

203
00:12:56,880 --> 00:12:58,480
the Celestial Realm is no more

204
00:12:58,520 --> 00:13:00,680
so there is no point in me punishing you.

205
00:13:55,760 --> 00:13:56,600
A single strike

206
00:13:56,640 --> 00:13:58,160
destroyed 2 swords of the Sword Saint.

207
00:13:58,880 --> 00:14:00,240
This Celestial is impressive !

208
00:14:00,440 --> 00:14:02,440
So that's the power of a Celestial.

209
00:14:01,600 --> 00:14:03,320
A single strike destroyed both my swords.

210
00:14:03,680 --> 00:14:05,760
Not even the All-Seer could do this.

211
00:14:06,560 --> 00:14:08,280
This woman is not a normal Celestial.

212
00:14:08,880 --> 00:14:11,360
Could she be a Celestial King ?

213
00:14:11,920 --> 00:14:15,600
I won't be able to get a celestial sword today.

214
00:14:18,200 --> 00:14:18,840
Wait...

215
00:14:19,360 --> 00:14:20,880
According to the celestial law,

216
00:14:20,990 --> 00:14:23,240
my crime is worthy of destroying my Origin Soul.

217
00:14:23,280 --> 00:14:24,640
But she didn't kill me.

218
00:14:25,240 --> 00:14:27,080
It's not that she doesn’t want to kill me,

219
00:14:27,120 --> 00:14:28,560
she wants to scare me away !

220
00:14:38,840 --> 00:14:40,240
Celestial King,

221
00:14:40,520 --> 00:14:43,360
I want to see how powerful you are !

222
00:14:48,160 --> 00:14:48,960
Ting'er !

223
00:15:20,000 --> 00:15:20,840
A Celestial

224
00:15:20,840 --> 00:15:22,240
is only this strong ?

225
00:15:25,240 --> 00:15:26,240
A death aura ?

226
00:15:26,840 --> 00:15:28,960
She doesn't have much time left.

227
00:15:31,440 --> 00:15:35,280
You should give me the celestial swords !

228
00:15:46,160 --> 00:15:47,160
Ting'er !

229
00:15:47,240 --> 00:15:48,360
Let me out of here !

230
00:15:48,640 --> 00:15:50,120
If you use up all your celestial spiritual energy,

231
00:15:50,120 --> 00:15:51,840
you will never wake up again !

232
00:15:53,160 --> 00:15:54,400
You can't leave yet.

233
00:16:13,720 --> 00:16:14,440
Sword Spirit,

234
00:16:14,640 --> 00:16:15,160
go !

235
00:16:38,000 --> 00:16:39,320
All-Seer,

236
00:16:39,600 --> 00:16:41,520
if you keep me from taking the celestial sword,

237
00:16:41,560 --> 00:16:43,040
when I get back

238
00:16:43,440 --> 00:16:45,640
our sects will fight for 1000 years !

239
00:16:45,680 --> 00:16:46,760
The All-Seer ?!

240
00:16:47,280 --> 00:16:49,200
I am the All-Seer.

241
00:16:50,120 --> 00:16:51,800
Since we met, let's make a deal.

242
00:16:52,840 --> 00:16:55,520
The celestial sword belongs to those who are fated to have it.

243
00:16:55,560 --> 00:16:56,840
If you can get it,

244
00:16:57,240 --> 00:16:58,720
then you are fated.

245
00:17:02,800 --> 00:17:03,760
Tian Mozi !

246
00:17:13,720 --> 00:17:14,760
I'm not greedy.

247
00:17:14,760 --> 00:17:16,240
Of the 4 celestial swords,

248
00:17:16,360 --> 00:17:17,360
I’ll only take one.

249
00:17:17,640 --> 00:17:18,360
Goodbye.

250
00:17:19,880 --> 00:17:21,960
You dare to steal from me ?

251
00:17:22,240 --> 00:17:24,280
My Da Lou Sword Sect will wipe your planet Tian Mo !

252
00:17:24,320 --> 00:17:25,640
Sure, I'll be waiting for you.

253
00:17:41,240 --> 00:17:43,200
You can have this sword

254
00:17:43,360 --> 00:17:45,400
but the Sword Spirit is mine.

255
00:17:52,440 --> 00:17:54,120
This sword belongs to me !

256
00:17:55,440 --> 00:17:57,280
This celestial sword lost its Sword Spirit

257
00:17:57,640 --> 00:17:59,880
so it cannot use any of its spells anymore...

258
00:18:00,520 --> 00:18:02,000
Ling Tianhou,

259
00:18:02,160 --> 00:18:04,800
you obtaining this sword is heavenly fate

260
00:18:04,880 --> 00:18:06,640
so I won’t stop you.

261
00:18:06,840 --> 00:18:08,720
But know your own limits…

262
00:18:13,880 --> 00:18:15,760
You don't have much life left in you.

263
00:18:16,320 --> 00:18:18,240
Since you're a Celestial,

264
00:18:18,360 --> 00:18:19,800
I won't kill you.

265
00:18:20,160 --> 00:18:23,000
But I will take the Sword Spirits of the remaining 2 swords !

266
00:18:48,920 --> 00:18:49,720
Ting'er !

267
00:18:49,840 --> 00:18:50,680
Stop !

268
00:18:57,080 --> 00:18:57,920
Ting'er !

269
00:19:27,680 --> 00:19:29,400
Break for me !

270
00:19:40,040 --> 00:19:41,520
Ting'er !!!

271
00:19:41,720 --> 00:19:45,160
I am not the true soul of a Celestial King.

272
00:19:46,320 --> 00:19:50,000
I am a remnant of a soul that was condensed somehow.

273
00:19:51,240 --> 00:19:53,720
But when you ignited your Origin Soul,

274
00:19:54,200 --> 00:19:55,560
I understood.

275
00:19:56,680 --> 00:19:59,120
I was born out of your obsession for me…

276
00:20:00,680 --> 00:20:01,760
Zhou Yi,

277
