Falling from the night sky and melting into dust
like water without a source.

287
00:21:15,620 --> 00:21:21,710
Like the difference between clouds and mud,
the truth cannot be found in conflict.

288
00:21:21,820 --> 00:21:25,650
Life and death
are like the moment when the rain falls

289
00:21:25,680 --> 00:21:29,580
and like many other unseparable things.

290
00:21:29,940 --> 00:21:35,590
In this lifetime,
to cultivate the truth, cultivate the world first.

291
00:21:36,770 --> 00:21:42,600
Old grudges had to be settled
because half an inch is engraved into my tree rings.

292
00:21:42,910 --> 00:21:48,450
Use the most vivid love and hate
to ask questions to your fate.

293
00:21:48,910 --> 00:21:53,130
Let your eyes be filled enough with rage
to pierce the heart and the soul

294
00:21:53,390 --> 00:21:56,620
then soften because of the mortals' fireworks.

295
00:21:56,790 --> 00:22:02,610
Only when you bend down can you understand
the hidden edge of the blade.

296
00:22:03,130 --> 00:22:06,810
The human mind is nature,
the rain fell silently like an answer.

297
00:22:06,910 --> 00:22:10,730
Life and death are just moments away,
there are many other solutions to grudges.

298
00:22:10,910 --> 00:22:16,580
Use your dusty heart
to depict the world.

299
00:22:16,840 --> 00:22:20,510
One stroke is for killing.
After struggling for hundreds of years, I endured letting go.

300
00:22:20,720 --> 00:22:24,290
One stroke is for caring.
Everywhere there is life, there are thousands of lights.

301
00:22:24,410 --> 00:22:30,330
Give up your mind to be refined
by this endless world.

